Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.44,Default,,0,0,150,,Coming up on {\i1}Punirunes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, pet it, take care of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's play, Punirunes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is squishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Punirunes. Before we knew it, these creatures\Nbegan to inhabit the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're squishsterious and soft to the touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They all love to be squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they're kachi-freezy and hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,These are some merry, adorable puni-pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, there could be\Na Punirune right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Otorune and the Kachi-Freezy Festival{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is Jewelrune worked up about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.02,0:01:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.02,0:01:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you, Jewelrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jewelrune is asking them about\Nthe Kachi-Freezy Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the Kachi-Freezy Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Kachi-Kochi Festival is an event\Nheld in Kachikochiland once a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's vendors and dance performances.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It wants to bring something new this year\Nto make the festival more exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's hoping they may have some ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tomorune, you got something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sounds like it has just the perfect puni-pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}It's the mischief-maker Togerune,\Nand it looks like it's plotting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They've arrived in Puniland\Nto meet Togerune's puni-pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}This is Otorune! It loves music\Nand getting others excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Otorune, I need you to bring some\Nexcitement to the Kachi-Freezy Festival!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"You have to come with me now!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Right now?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Sorry, this is way too sudden."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Let us go."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nice, you got its approval!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With that settled, off to\Nthe Kachi-Freezy Festival we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the Kachi-Freezy Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It appears to already be underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"What pretty colors!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I am not worthy of your praises,\Nbut I will accept them humbly."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Hey, don't worry 'bout it."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"These are cool too!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"How kind. I am deeply honored."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Hey, don't worry 'bout it..."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Otorune makes its move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"That's real rad! You rock it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"So do you! So do you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Even you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"It rocks when y'all are hyped, oh yeah!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here's its next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lively music and a spinning disco ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Otorune, you rock!\NYou got the whole festival on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.49,0:07:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is Togerune up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh no! Togerune's going to prickle Otorune!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It can't prickle kachi-freeziness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not rapping, but rapuni-ng!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time for a freestyle rapuni battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Otorune, Togerune, you're up!\NCheck it out, y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your toge-thorns are super fly\NYour prickling is sky-high{トゲトゲ最高\Nちくって最強}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Those talents of yours\NWill set us all free{キミの才能\N皆を解放}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your thorns shine so bright\NThey're your very own delight{トゲトゲのキラメキ\Nキミだけの輝き}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So listen up, if you may\NTo what your heart's gotta say{胸のときめきに\N耳を貸すべき}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, man\NYour taste is totally rad{お前のセンス桁外れ}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Got everyone down bad\NLet it drive you mad{みんなほれぼれ\Nのりまくれ}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all unique and astray\NLet it be that way{個性はそれぞれ\N咲き誇れ}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's festival time, let's partay{カチコチフェスで踊れー}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a-Togerune\NI'm over the moon{ありがとげるん\N気分はルンルン}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just being with you\NMakes my heart race away{キミがいるんで\N心はランラン}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Squishies and thornies\NGet along, spilled the tea{ぷにぷにトゲトゲ\N関係暴かれ}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't stop longing to be\NWho you wanna see{それでもあこがれ強くあれ}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Speak! The party's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you, Otorune! The hype is in the air, whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so, this year's Kachi-Freezy Festival\Ncomes to an end. It was a massive success.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's all, until next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-Pal Files!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll tell you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Jewelrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jewelrune is the prince of Kachikochiland!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:10:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very cool when it's kachi-freezy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.91,0:10:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's loved by everyone in Kachikochiland!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Puni-Pal Squestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How does Jewelrune act when it's puni-squishy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,422)}1. Short-tempered
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,694)}2. Spoiled
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,960.67)}3. Lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,2. Spoiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ururune, I hear you're the arts and crafts teacher!\NYou're gonna teach about art!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense, you're really great at drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, it's tough teaching everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I believe you'll be a great teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that you got there, Ururune?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Ururune and the Bouquet of Memories{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"Puni" in next time!
